  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/952c967501c582f1911db7fefdaaefa9b6e3f505512624eb925e04e002be5a1f.png] \n\nGiven : \n\n \n \n\n Signs\n +\n -\n ×\n ÷\n \n \n\n Means\n -\n ×\n ÷\n +\n \n \n\nSo, after interchanging the signs :\n\n__\n \n• Option - (1) :\n\n96 ÷ 3 + 56 × 16 - 5 = 45 ⇒ 96 + 3 - **56 **____**÷**____** 16**__ × 5 = 45\n\n96 + 3 - **__3.5__**__** ×**____** 5**__ = 45\n\n__**96 + 3**__ - 17.5 = 45\n\n__**99 - 17.5**__ = 45\n\n82.5 ≠ 45 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (2) :\n\n20 + 44 ÷ 11 × 3 - 9 = 30 ⇒ 20 - 44 + **11 **____**÷**____** 3**__ × 9 = 30\n\n20 - 44 + __3.67** **____**×**____** 9**__ = 30\n\n__**20 + 33.03**__ - 44 = 30\n\n__**53.03 - 44**__ = 30\n\n9.03 ≠ 30 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (3) :\n\n108 + 3 - 36 × 6 ÷ 15 = 105 ⇒ 108 - 3 × **36 **____**÷**____** 6**__ + 15 = 105\n\n108 - __**3 **____**× **____6__ + 15 = 105\n\n__**108 + 15**__ - 18 = 105\n\n__**123 - 18**__ = 105\n\n**105 = 105 (LHS = RHS)**\n\n__\n \n• Option - (4) :\n\n15 - 6 × 15 + 80 ÷ 2 = 25 ⇒ 15 × **6 **____**÷**____** 15**__ - 80 + 2 = 25\n\n__**15 ×**____** **__**__0.4__** - 80 + 2 = 25\n\n__**6 + 2**__ - 80 = 25\n\n__**8 - 80**__ = 25\n\n-72 ≠ 25 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nHence, \"**Option - (3)**\" is the correct answer.",
